recommend check-in Keaton -- the loop is ready to restart on paths proven at their new depth, and the two genuine module reds from the random draw (pool_isolation_witness and pond_ring_lantern_witness, both calling a member linengrow/capabilities.rye has since dropped) are the first thing a fresh lap should take.
